# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a local preference.
#
# The fuel pipeline rewrites pipelines/fuel_prices/prices.csv byte for byte
# every time it learns a month (parse.py::_persist), and a test pins that the
# rewrite reproduces the committed file exactly. With the common Windows
# core.autocrlf=true, a fresh clone would hand pandas a CRLF file, the test
# would go red and the first CI refresh would land a 385-line diff instead of
# three appended rows. Pin the working-tree ending instead of asking every
# clone to configure itself.
*.csv text eol=lf

# Published data and the saved source snapshots are binary; keep git's
# heuristics out of them entirely.
*.parquet binary
*.xlsx binary
